CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

All audio files in this directory were synthesised from scratch for the
divisi project using numpy oscillators, envelopes and filters, plus ffmpeg
for the final encode to Ogg Vorbis. No samples, recordings, loops, sample
packs, or any other third-party audio material were used at any stage.
Nothing in this directory was downloaded, sampled from an existing
recording, or generated by a third-party sound library. The synthesis
script that produced these files lives in the project notes, alongside a
printed log of the checks it ran (loop length, loop-seam continuity, peak
levels, and encoded duration for every file).

To the extent possible under law, the person who associated this work with
this dedication has waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights
to this work worldwide. This work is published from the United States.

You can copy, modify, distribute and perform the work, even for commercial
purposes, all without asking permission.

See the full legal text of the dedication at:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

